  "goodToKnow": "Das Gesundheitswesen is the health care system. Germany's is one of the oldest, going back to Bismarck's health insurance law of 1883. About 90 percent of people are in a gesetzliche Krankenversicherung (statutory insurance, like AOK or TK), and the rest are privat versichert. The suffix -wesen means system or sector: das Bildungswesen (education), das Finanzwesen, das Schulwesen. On its own, das Wesen means a being or nature."
